<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5350/5390.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5350/5390.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5350/5390 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Friday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Saturday will be 5370.</p>
<p>On Thursday the bid/offer rates were 5347/5387, with the official dollar rate 5367 from Friday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5202/5802 after 5199/5799.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
